tasks/BACKLOG.md:122:🧵 **hero-slot-clip-split READY-FOR-GATES → ✅ SHIPPED a51fe3db4 (drained; see the SHIPPED row above) (Claude Opus 5 on scratch `wt-hero`, branch `feat/hero-slot-clip-split`, 2026-09-07).** Clips carry a GROUP in `assets/layer-contracts/characters.v2.json`; the slot's default group always loads (it is the walk/idle fallback chain), a non-default group loads when a scene declares it (`SPRITE_CLIP_GROUPS`: the town declares `town`, the claim `town`+`claim`) and otherwise warms on the advance stream's idle callback WHEN ITS PLAN DRAINS. Late groups merge into the LIVE `RuntimeSlot`, so a group that arrives mid-scene starts playing; a clip already atlased costs nothing to add. MEASURED, the deploy's instrument on the e1 release build, both projects: the hero's slot in the first-town window **8,901,114 B / 141 responses → 4,590,285 B / 106**, window total 20,363,574 (desktop) / 20,412,264 (mobile) → **16,101,435 B on both**; `char-hero-sheet-work8` (29 cells) + `char-hero-sheet-attack8` (6) 35 responses → 0. THE FIRST SWING DOES NOT STALL: on a cold claim entry the attack cells complete BEFORE the hero sprite is playable at all — swing stall 0 ms, three runs at loopback and three at 8 Mbps/100 ms, on both the cured and the uncured build. Warming at `assetLoadingState=ready` was measured and REJECTED: it put all 35 cells back in the window (not one byte moved), because the probe observes that signal by polling. STATED, NOT HIDDEN: the wall clock does NOT show the saving — paired town-ready reads 2126 ms before / 2501 after on loopback and 5838 / 5780 at 8 Mbps, while two runs of the SAME cured build differ by 25 %, because four implementers shared this host and `assetLoadingState` tracks the GLTF manager, not the sheets this slice removes. Read no town-ready improvement into it; the payload is the reproducible fact. New guard `scripts/hero-clip-groups.test.mjs` (7/7, proven to bite on three injected faults); family allowlist carries the dated reason; e2e `task-025` + `vp-02-sprite-animation` + `tape-01-run-tape` + `beauty-town` + `hero-pose-library` 52/52 both projects. Evidence: `artifacts/hero-slot-clip-split/`. GATE (unchanged, now met): work8 + attack8 out of the first-town window, the first swing does not stall (measured), families updated, guards green.
