atch/`. Carried, fire-authorable: F-ECB-1 (two stale clauses in `E10PreserveSystem.ts:402` / `E10SquallScheduler.ts:322`), F-ECB-2 (`gr.countyStandings.anonId.v1` survives a profile delete; move onto `profileDataKey`), F-ECB-3 (three specs still widen the diagnostics type), F-ECB-4 (HAZARD CLASS: a sparse worktree without `/logs/` lets an append create `logs/task-stats.jsonl` at zero bytes, which reads as a Retention-Law deletion; caught, restored; the sparse sets must carry the appended ledgers). Goal leaf flipped to merged in this commit.
