e honest ladder: the first ride died at wave 15 with sixteen defaulted picks and a 100-hp hero, and reading `now.pendingOffer` for `tinkers_plating` (100 → 175 hp) is the lever (the F-RVW-5 wall, answered with the door's own offers). Floors unmoved (re-measured byte-identical). Guard `relay-rush-reel` 5/5 (the heaviest file in the battery, 73-148 s). ON THE MERGED TREE (attended 22:45-22:50): `package.json` unioned (116 guards; both implementers moved the seven inert guards independently, F-RRR-1 = F-SCR-1); tsc clean; era guard 5/5 (no engine input touched, top pin `6dfdde6f` unmoved); six guard files 66/66; e2e `er01-e7-census` + `contract-briefings` 22 passed (1.4 m) both projects. Review `reviews/relay-rush-replays-again.md`; evidence `artifacts/relay-rush-replays-again/`. Carried: F-RRR-4 (the prover's tape is 21 % over `maxTapeBytes` with 669 entries against 601: the envelope prices policy classes, the F-HEAT12-2 / F-DBW-1 thread), F-RRR-5 (`contract-briefings` rewrites 12 tracked PNGs; F-HMV-2 class), F-RRR-6 (heat 11's stale doorRisk note). Goal leaf flipped to merged in this commit.
tasks/BACKLOG.md:160:🚀✅ **secure-choice-refusal-both-cures SHIPPED 14c163c87 (attended drain 2026-09-06 ~22:10; Claude Opus 5 on scratch `wt-secure`) — THE SECURE WINDOW ANSWERS THE RIDER, AND ITS CLOCK RUNS (owner, verbatim: "(5) both"; F-MCAP-1).** Before: a plan concatenated behind `SECURE_CHOICE` during the open window looped 8,783 turns in 35 s and never ended, `expiresInMs` pinned at 20,000, every view byte-identical. After: the submission is refused on the order channel with `SECURE_CHOICE_ONLY` ("while the secure window is open, the only accepted submission is a single SECURE_CHOICE; answer the choice, then re-send the rest of the plan"; `needsRider` true the same turn) and `gr-sim` prints the same sentence as ONE stderr line (stdout stays strict NDJSON); each refused turn spends one fixed step of the pending clock (20,000 → 0, one 1/30 s step per refusal), so the choice defaults through the EXISTING expiry path in `step()`: 601 turns = `pickSeconds × 30 + 1`, exit 0, 11 s, `defaultedSecure: 1`. `secureWindowOpen` split from `pendingSecure` in the diagnostics, gating only the one-order rule; the browser door unchanged; accepted paths, tapes and floors untouched (`null-floor-anchors --check` only the pre-existing eraStamp; the air-wall prover tape replays to `fnv1a32:41ae7f17` before and after). Guard `secure-choice-refusal` 2/2 (the bound from the ride's own first view, ceiling 2,000). ON THE MERGED TREE (attended 21:55-22:10): tsc clean; era-5 pin `60415d3f` 5/5; build green; fifteen guard files 127 tests 125 pass / 2 ruled skips / 0 fail; `board-tape-gold` 4/4; e2e `ap16-6-browser-seat` + `tape-01-run-tape` 14 passed (14.0 s) both projects. 🛠️ **F-SCR-1 CURED IN THIS DRAIN (package.json):** `test:node-guards` ended in `&& node scripts/nul-audit.mjs <seven test files>` and `nul-audit.mjs` reads argv only for `--quiet`, so `e10-squall-scheduler`, `board-tape-gold`, `contract-hero-grit-override`, `run-tape-envelope-budget`, `e10-preserve-consumer`, `hero-move