ourth running that the rotting slice predicted in its own report; (2) append the era-5 pin.** `twist.emberShore.squall.recoverSeconds: 8` is AUTHORED-NOT-RATIFIED and flagged as such (the spec names three durations, the slice names four phases; derived as the telegraph's mirror rather than picked, and put in DATA so one token retunes it); the `engineDependencies` entry is NARROWED to name the landed half rather than flipped to `landed`, because the schema pins `status` to the literal `'missing'` (`src/meta/ContractFamilies.ts:1810`, `entry.status !== 'missing'`). Evidence `artifacts/e10s-2-squall/`.
