ry red being `story-loop:185` (F-2460-2's reload red), `ss-11` 14/14 and `ss-10` 10/10 green on both projects. Review `reviews/ss-11-e10-beats.md`; shots `reviews/shots-ss-11-e10-beats/` (8). Carried: F-SS11-1 (THE QUIET has no boss signal: the `boss-act-signals` slice with F-SS09-3/F-SS10-1), F-SS11-2 (superseded: `story-signal-emitters` landed `wave-complete` the same night), F-SS11-3 (the four Deep Sky consumers, E10S ladder), F-SS11-4 (E10 portraits, the E5–E10 art batch). Goal leaf flipped to merged in this commit.
