he ten stale `e3-moth-season`/E8 rows of F-PICNIC-3), ZERO E1 rows among them: the emitters moved no floor. Review `reviews/story-signal-emitters.md`; shots `reviews/shots-story-signal-emitters/` (14). Carried: F-SSE-1 (`first-boot` has no consuming beat: one E1 table row, fire-authorable), F-SSE-3 (the first-boot key is not in `PROFILE_DATA_KEYS`, one line), F-SS10-1 + F-SS09-3 CONFIRMED (boss signals sit below `if (!baron) return` and the Claw/Digger maps declare no baron: a `boss-act-signals` slice with call sites inside the boss systems), F-SS06-2 CONFIRMED (`run-return-town` carries no contract id: one field + one argument), F-SSE-4 (pre-existing empty-hash replay of `artifacts/eh2-fixture/tape.json` through the browser path). Goal leaf flipped to merged in this commit.
