banks 5, e1-baron 5; e.g. `the-claim/e1-the-claim-01 fnv1a32:e9c32234`), and `tape-01-run-tape.spec.ts:140` ("every ended run writes a keepable tape whose replay reproduces its event hash") green on both projects. EVIDENCE: `npx tsc --noEmit` clean · `npm run build` rc=0 (herald 1,158,214 B under the 1,500,000 B ceiling) · new plain-boot spec `e2e/story-signal-emitters.spec.ts` **8/8 desktop-chrome + 390px mobile-chrome (6.9 m)**, no `?debug` anywhere in it, zero console/page errors · closing battery `story-signal-emitters + ss-01 + ss-02 + ss-03 + ss-04 + story-loop + profile-first-boot + tape-01`, `--workers=1`, both projects: **60 passed / 6 failed, and the 6 are exactly the F-2460-2 known set** (`ss-01-beats:103`, `ss-03-beats:52`, `story-loop:185` × 2 projects) · 14 screenshots in `reviews/shots-story-signal-emitters/` (1.9 MB, JPEG q60), one per beat per project. **F-2460-2 DELTA: ZERO of the six turned green, and none of them can** — measured, not assumed: `ss-01:103` fails because a `ledger-page:town_elder` card jumps the queue ahead of `first-contract` (trigger `ledger-page`, which already had an emitter at `src/encyclopedia/state.ts:53`); `ss-03:52` is a pure `E2_STORY_BEATS` table assertion with no page and no signal; `story-loop:185` never sees `claim-secured` because its `tunePlainFastSecure` runs BEFORE `launchContract`'s `window.location.reload()` (`src/main.ts:271`), which re-imports `Balance` and re-runs `applyStoredDifficultyPreset()` over the tuning. All three were CONTROL-PROVEN pre-existing by reverting `src/game/Game.ts` + `src/main.ts` to `main` and reproducing them. **OWED TO THE DRAIN: engine pin `fbbb8720fd53b0f73e17e88fe17dfe10085065e0e4a0bf87e8e429e9dd137d9a`** (era 5) — `src/**` is inside `ENGINE_SOURCE_INPUTS`, so `engine-era-guard` reds 1/5 naming exactly that hash; `assets/engine-era.json` is outside this task's firewall. Guards run green: `agent-rung-conformance` 3/3, `view-schema-guard` 3/3, `no-emdash-guard` 1/1. FINDINGS (reported