gazette-art-wiring` registered same commit, `drain-block-check` ✅ CLEAR. ⚠️ **Its blocking requirement is F-1184-1, found by the art drain:** `scripts/asset-diet.mjs:56` selects PNGs for optimization by **exact dimensions** (`(width===1671||width===1672)&&height===941`) — the mechanism that cuts the plate tier **87%** — so the 1024² herald cuts are **invisible to it** at **2.14–2.35 MB each**, and a naive eager `?url` glob ships **~15.4 MB unoptimized** to a browser game. The master orders measure-first with a hard **≤1.5 MB `dist/` budget as THE gate**. Also settled: `news/herald.json` holds exactly **four** live items (board/river/schoolhouse/ledger), so **trail/boss/town-growth have no live item and the UNCLASSIFIED path is the common path** — no-regression on it is a numbered scope item. ⚠️ **`⛔ lane-a must NOT be reset` is RETIRED** — proved safe by content this fire: `65041a9c`'s only file is blob-identical on main (`2702c0fb…`) and the lane's sole two-dot additions are `.wrangler/tmp/**` scratch main deliberately deleted. **✅✅ WIRING DRAINED s1185 — THE LADDER IS COMPLETE AND THE HERALD SHOWS ITS CUTS** (`0167f958`, `reviews/gazette-art-wiring.md`, leaf `gazette-art-wiring`=shipped). **F-1184-1's budget was MET with 5.3× headroom and the number was re-measured by the drain, not inherited:** naive **16,492,796 B → 281,444 B** as 384 px WebP; and the collateral question the widened selector raises was answered by enumerating **all 1349 `dist/` PNGs** — exactly **7** are 1024², **all 7 are herald cuts**, so zero collateral today, with **0 dangling `.png` refs** left in `dist/`. Gates on the merged tree: tsc rc=0, build green, own spec **4/4 dev + 4/4 production-preview**, adjacent `asset-diet` **4/4**, both mutation controls **RED on demand (exit 1 each)**, zero console/page errors desktop + 390 px, screenshots at `artifacts/gazette-art-wiring/`. ➡️ **NO NEXT RUNG HERE** — `trail`/`boss`/`town-growth` stay unused by design until the ticker/gazette pipeline suppl